{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06767","headline":"诸官游招隐寺 · 王昌龄","name":"诸官游招隐寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山馆人已空，青萝换风雨。\n自从永明世，月向龙宫吐。\n凿井长幽泉，白云今如古。\n应真坐松柏，锡杖挂窗户。\n口云七十余，能救诸有苦。\n回指岩树花，如闻道场鼓。\n金色身壤灭，真如性无主。\n僚友同一心，清光遣谁取。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}